  "name": "Rivers 1:2,000,000 - PWS, Copper Rivers",
  "description": "Data Type: Freshwater Systems; This layer contains major river data for the Prince William Sound - Copper River ecosystem at 1:2,000,000 scale. Pacific GIS derived this layer from a statewide, Digital Line Graph (DLG) coverage obtained from USGS.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: unknown",
